      "message": "I think I want to yield and defer to @ccameron on this CL.  At the same time (maybe unfairly, since I am yielding :-P) let me share two notes:\n\n* This CL reminds me a little bit of https://review.skia.org/917191 where a similar UaF had to be fixed in Rust PNG decoder.  The fix in this other CL was different - it seemed that `SkEncodedInfo::ICCProfile::Make` requires a long-lived/owning `SkData`.  I wonder if a similar API requirement may exist around the APIs touched by this CL.\n* I note that `std::shared_ptr\u003cT\u003e` is currently [banned](https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/styleguide/c++/c++-features.md#std_shared_ptr-banned) in Chromium, but maybe this doesn\u0027t matter because 1) this is Skia and 2) IIUC Chromium doesn\u0027t have any specific reason to ban (other than consistency + cost to migrate).",
